},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Shøöt-Archimonde|h[|cff8788eeShøöt-Archimonde|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:63325:Player-1302-0CAE0274:1:8:20:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Omnium Folio Studies]|h|r!",
["id"] = "s20_3127",
["timestamp"] = 1787243746,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Archmage Y'mera",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Archmage Y'mera waves you over to speak with her.",
["id"] = "s20_3128",
["timestamp"] = 1787243902,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Commander Tala'saan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Commander Tala'saan says: Affirmative, Kvotheen. We will mobilize to meet you and Maella in the Voidstorm.",
["id"] = "s20_3129",
["timestamp"] = 1787243902,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Archmage Y'mera",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Archmage Y'mera says: While cloaked with invisibility, take hold of the tether from the beacon and see how far you can extend it.",
["id"] = "s20_3130",
["timestamp"] = 1787243909,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Kvotheen",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.8666667342185974,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "While stealthed or invisible, pull the tether as far as you can to test the device.",
["id"] = "s20_3131",
["timestamp"] = 1787243913,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Commander Tala'saan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Commander Tala'saan says: Will the cloaking tether be operational, Y'mera? Maella is counting on it to keep our arrival point hidden.",
["id"] = "s20_3132",
["timestamp"] = 1787243920,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Archmage Y'mera",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Archmage Y'mera says: Did I not promise the Riftblade she would have her defenses, Commander? A few more adjustments is all I require.",
["id"] = "s20_3133",
["timestamp"] = 1787243927,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY",
["type"] = "CURRENCY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3405:0|h[Field Accolade]|h|rx10",
["id"] = "s20_3134",
["timestamp"] = 1787243935,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: Champion, a moment if you would!",
["id"] = "s20_3135",
["timestamp"] = 1787243979,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Belath Dawnblade",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Belath Dawnblade says: Very well, Kvotheen. We will meet you in the Voidstorm.",
["id"] = "s20_3136",
["timestamp"] = 1787243979,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: With Spectral Sight active, simply locate and stomp out any Shadows you find. My attuned Sight Ward will do the rest.",
["id"] = "s20_3137",
["timestamp"] = 1787243984,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: Thank you, Kvotheen. Attuning the Umbral Sight Ward should bolster our camp's defenses when we arrive.",
["id"] = "s20_3138",
["timestamp"] = 1787244021,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY",
["type"] = "CURRENCY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|Hcurrency:3405:0|h[Field Accolade]|h|rx10",
["id"] = "s20_3139",
["timestamp"] = 1787244034,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Projected Image of Decimus",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Projected Image of Decimus says: Light... Fel... Void. The perfect recipe for upsetting tensions. How delicious.",
["id"] = "s20_3140",
["timestamp"] = 1787244036,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riftblade Maella",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Riftblade Maella glares at the projection of Decimus.",
["id"] = "s20_3141",
["timestamp"] = 1787244047,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Human",
["class"] = "PALADIN",
["name"] = "Herza-Eitrigg",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Herza-Eitrigg:626:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaHerza|r]|h: yop",
["id"] = "s20_3142",
["timestamp"] = 1787244048,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Grand Magister Rommath",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Grand Magister Rommath says: Silvermoon's students have unique ways of studying the arcane. Perhaps you could learn a thing or two.",
["id"] = "s20_3143",
["timestamp"] = 1787244058,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Decimus",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Decimus says: I hope your little strike team is ready. I can already taste the conflict beyond this rift.",
["id"] = "s20_3144",
["timestamp"] = 1787244093,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riftblade Maella",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Riftblade Maella says: If you are done instigating, Decimus, our riftwardens stand at the ready.",
["id"] = "s20_3145",
["timestamp"] = 1787244101,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riftblade Maella",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Riftblade Maella says: Stars guide our path. Forward!",
["id"] = "s20_3146",
["timestamp"] = 1787244114,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
