},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Calystha-Hyjal|h[|cff3fc7ebCalystha|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62871:Player-1390-0C81B546:1:8:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Season 2: Catalyst Unbound]|h|r!",
["id"] = "s21_3203",
["timestamp"] = 1787728241,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kor Dawnchaser",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kor Dawnchaser says: If the Horde and Alliance can stand together here, maybe this is what peace is supposed to look like.",
["id"] = "s21_3204",
["timestamp"] = 1787728342,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zekhan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zekhan says: Or maybe Silvermoon is just quiet right now. Quiet doesn't mean healed.",
["id"] = "s21_3205",
["timestamp"] = 1787728348,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kor Dawnchaser",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kor Dawnchaser says: You think everything is temporary. That makes it impossible to build anything.",
["id"] = "s21_3206",
["timestamp"] = 1787728353,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zekhan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zekhan says: And you think everything can be fixed. That makes it easy to ignore when it breaks.",
["id"] = "s21_3207",
["timestamp"] = 1787728358,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Gorgonna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gorgonna says: Both of you are wrong and right at the same time. That is why leaders stop talking and start watching. Keep your voices down. This city has heard enough war already.",
["id"] = "s21_3208",
["timestamp"] = 1787728363,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Orweyna",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Orweyna says: Ula'tek's influence here is overwhelming. Dark acts have stained this place.",
["id"] = "s21_3209",
["timestamp"] = 1787728677,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Tauren",
["class"] = "PALADIN",
["name"] = "Røscoe",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Røscoe sets out a Transmorpher Beacon!",
["id"] = "s21_3210",
["timestamp"] = 1787728683,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: De heart of de temple. Dis must be where de Soulcoilers performed their rituals.",
["id"] = "s21_3211",
["timestamp"] = 1787728683,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Tauren",
["class"] = "PALADIN",
["name"] = "Røscoe",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Røscoe yells: Skill with a weapon is but a physical manifestation of one's martial strength. Let me show you what spiritual power is!",
["id"] = "s21_3212",
["timestamp"] = 1787728686,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
