onfrérieduThorium|h[|cfff48cbaNaramis-ConfrérieduThorium|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62185:Player-1127-0B360686:1:3:25:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ever Painting]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s10_3020\",\"timestamp\":1774459084},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Do you think returning Anasterian's relics will convince those like Aethas to allow you to return?\",\"id\":\"s10_3021\",\"timestamp\":1774459100},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: I don't intend it as a bribe. But if relics of the last king must return home, then perhaps the quel'dorei deserve the same?\",\"id\":\"s10_3022\",\"timestamp\":1774459106},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251899::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Anasterian's Book of Law]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_3023\",\"timestamp\":1774459112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: High King Anasterian's book of law. He applied its dictates equally to all his subjects.\",\"id\":\"s10_3024\",\"timestamp\":1774459112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251904::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Crown of the High King]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_3025\",\"timestamp\":1774459127},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: Passed down from Anasterian's great grandfather, this crown adorned the brow of every quel'dorei king.\",\"id\":\"s10_3026\",\"timestamp\":1774459128},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: I hope that these relics of Anasterian are enough to remind Silvermoon that we are still one people.\",\"id\":\"s10_3027\",\"timestamp\":1774459135},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:264286::::::::90:263::25:1:12769:1:28:3320:::::|h[Voidbreaker's Choker]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_3028\",\"timestamp\":1774459155},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"id\":\"s10_3029\",\"timestamp\":1774459156},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Purged of Dalaran\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Purged of Dalaran says: We were innocent!\",\"id\":\"s10_3030\",\"timestamp\":1774459193},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Purged of Dalaran\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Purged of Dalaran says: Bear the unending weight of guilt!\",\"id\":\"s10_3031\",\"timestamp\":1774459193},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Purged of Dalaran\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Purged of Dalaran says: Bear the unending weight of guilt!\",\"id\":\"s10_3032\",\"timestamp\":1774459203},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258873::::::::90:263:::1:13611:2:9:90:28:3322:::::|h[Frayed Tunic]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_3033\",\"timestamp\":1774459204},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:258041::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Remains of the Fallen]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s10_3034\",\"timestamp\":1774459204},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 53 Silver, 62 Copper (+5 Silver, 6 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s10_3035\",\"timestamp\":1774459205},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Purged of Dalaran\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Purged of Dalaran says: Bear the unending weight of guil