\"id\":\"s10_3842\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1006:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: Machine à grouper activée!! Envoyez-moi +1 en MP pour être aspirés dans le raid !\",\"timestamp\":1774554481,\"id\":\"s10_3843\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: There are those who would look down upon us, champion--who would turn their noses at the blood we have spilled.\",\"timestamp\":1774554512,\"id\":\"s10_3844\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1033:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: Machine à grouper activée!! Envoyez-moi +1 en MP pour être aspirés dans le raid !\",\"timestamp\":1774554589,\"id\":\"s10_3845\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: But from that blood we have drawn power. The power to defend our city. The power to annihilate our foes.\",\"timestamp\":1774554595,\"id\":\"s10_3846\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: Just as Silvermoon was not rebuilt in a day, so too will the consequences of our work here unfold over the years to come. They might not be fully felt today, or tomorrow...\",\"timestamp\":1774554604,\"id\":\"s10_3847\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: ...but when they are, all of Azeroth will come to fear the might and determination of the blood elves.\",\"timestamp\":1774554618,\"id\":\"s10_3848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Astalor Bloodsworn says: You are the teeth of my predation--a hero of the people!\",\"timestamp\":1774554647,\"id\":\"s10_3849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"To |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1054:WHISPER:ØSKYTANKUL-ARCHIMONDE|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h: +1\",\"timestamp\":1774554656,\"id\":\"s10_3850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We are deep in enemy territory. Time to strike!\",\"id\":\"s10_3851\",\"timestamp\":1774554724},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: Some meddlesome miscreants have spread acorns around the Cradle. Clean them up, won't you?\",\"id\":\"s10_3852\",\"timestamp\":1774554809},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Pauleau-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID\",\"type\":\"RAID\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.4980392456054688,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:RAID|h[Raid]|h |Hplayer:Pauleau-Dalaran:1106:RAID:|h[|cff3fc7ebPauleau-Dalaran|r]|h: Accepter la Quête |cffffff00|Hquest:93053:4567|h[Nettoyage de la Tanière]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s10_3853\",\"timestamp\":1774554812},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1111:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: Machine à grouper activée!! Envoyez-moi +1 en MP pour être aspirés dans le raid !\",\"id\":\"s10_3854\",\"timestamp\":1774554912},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Delondra\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Delondra yells: I, Gamon, will save us!\",\"timestamp\":1774554974,\"id\":\"s10_3855\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Naramis-ConfrérieduThorium\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SAY\",\"type\":\"SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Naramis-ConfrérieduThorium:11:SAY:|h[|cfff48cbaNaramis-ConfrérieduThorium|r]|h says: On le savait Osky\",\"timestamp\":1774554976,\"id\":\"s10_3856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"nam