: This may feel a little uncomfortable.\",\"id\":\"s11_2511\",\"timestamp\":1774561915},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_LEADER\",\"type\":\"RAID_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.03921568766236305,\"g\":0.2784313857555389,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:RAID|h[Raid Leader]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1705:RAID:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h: Gabodémo-Dalaran a reçu |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249294::::::::90:268::3:3:6652:13333:12787:1:28:3607:::::|h[Lame du verdict aveugle]|h|r pour Légère amél. / double spé !\",\"id\":\"s11_2512\",\"timestamp\":1774561918},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_LEADER\",\"type\":\"RAID_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.03921568766236305,\"g\":0.2784313857555389,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:RAID|h[Raid Leader]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1707:RAID:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h: Iranus-Ysondre a reçu |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249294::::::::90:268::3:3:6652:13333:12787:1:28:3607:::::|h[Lame du verdict aveugle]|h|r pour Légère amél. / double spé !\",\"id\":\"s11_2513\",\"timestamp\":1774561922},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: We must make haste. Xal'atath is using Alleria's rage and pain to erode her mastery over the Void.\",\"id\":\"s11_2514\",\"timestamp\":1774561924},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:1709:WHISPER:JAMELMOIGNON-HYJAL|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h whispers: j'ai pris tellement de retard en gear\",\"id\":\"s11_2515\",\"timestamp\":1774561932},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: After what happened with Turalyon and Arator... I can see how Alleria would struggle to maintain control. I doubt I'd be able to, if it were me.\",\"id\":\"s11_2516\",\"timestamp\":1774561934},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_WHISPER\",\"type\":\"WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:1711:WHISPER:JAMELMOIGNON-HYJAL|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h whispers: en 4 jours de vacances mdr\",\"id\":\"s11_2517\",\"timestamp\":1774561942},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: Mother!\",\"id\":\"s11_2518\",\"timestamp\":1774561948},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: Alleria!\",\"id\":\"s11_2519\",\"timestamp\":1774561950},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: How touching. Your family has come to say goodbye.\",\"id\":\"s11_2520\",\"timestamp\":1774561952},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Ah, and my favorite champions as well! I was afraid you might miss this.\",\"id\":\"s11_2521\",\"timestamp\":1774561957},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"[Tank] |Hplayer:Øskytankul|h[Øskytankul]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aGabodémo\",\"id\":\"s11_2522\",\"timestamp\":1774561961},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner grimaces in pain.\",\"id\":\"s11_2523\",\"timestamp\":1774561966},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: What are you doing to her?!\",\"id\":\"s11_2524\",\"timestamp\":1774561967},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Keeping my promise, of course. Taking everything she loves. Leaving her with nothing but the Void.\",\"id\":\"s11_2525\",\"timestamp\":1774561969},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: No!\",\"id\":\"s11_2526\",\"timestamp\":1774561978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: I... can't move!\",\"id\":\"s11_2527\",\"timestamp\":1774561984},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: You are about to bear witness to a moment eons in the making. And she holds the key.\",\"id\":\"s11_2528\",\"timestamp\":1774561988},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_WHISPER_INFORM\",\"type\":\"WHISPER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"To |Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:1723:WHISPER:JAMELMOIGNON-HYJAL|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h: ah bah ouais cetait la semaine avec le m+ et tout en plus\",\"id\":\"s11_2529\",\"timestamp\":1774561991},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_LEADER\",\"type\":\"RAID_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.03921568766236305,\"g\":0.2784313857555389,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:RAID|h[Raid Leader]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1724:RAID:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h: Jamelmoignon-Hyjal a reçu |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249355::::::::90:268::3:3:13347:13338:13333:1:28:3607:::::|h[Cœur-de-néant fanatique tissé de Vide]|h|r pour BIS !\",\"id\":\"s11_2530\",\"timestamp\":1774561995},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner yells: You were warned!\",\"id\":\"s11_2531\",\"timestamp\":1774562004},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner yells: You brought this on yourself.\",\"id\":\"s11_2532\",\"timestamp\":1774562004},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Chammpagne-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Chammpagne-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddChammpagne|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42329:Player-1390-0D5E28F8:1:3:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Two Warband Mentors: Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s11_2533\",\"timestamp\":1774562008},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Chammpagne-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Chammpagne-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddChammpagne|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:7383:Player-1390-0D5E28F8:1:3:26:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Terrific Trio]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s11_2534\",\"timestamp\":1774562008},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_LEADER\",\"type\":\"RAID_LEADER\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.03921568766236305,\"g\":0.2784313857555389,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:RAID|h[Raid Leader]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:1735:RAID:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h: Hèlio a reçu |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249359::::::::90:268::3:3:13347:13339:13333::::::|h[Cœur-de-n