:\"s15_4856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: We must make haste. Xal'atath is using Alleria's rage and pain to erode her mastery over the Void.\",\"timestamp\":1776712668,\"id\":\"s15_4857\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|HlootHistory:3180|h[Loot]|h: Herza (Need - 11, Off-Spec) Won: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:249277::::::::90:263::5:3:6652:13334:12795:1:28:3606:::::|h[Bellamy's Final Judgement]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1776712668,\"id\":\"s15_4858\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: After what happened with Turalyon and Arator... I can see how Alleria would struggle to maintain control. I doubt I'd be able to, if it were me.\",\"timestamp\":1776712678,\"id\":\"s15_4859\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arator yells: Mother!\",\"timestamp\":1776712679,\"id\":\"s15_4860\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon yells: Alleria!\",\"timestamp\":1776712681,\"id\":\"s15_4861\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: How touching. Your family has come to say goodbye.\",\"timestamp\":1776712683,\"id\":\"s15_4862\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Still, should Xal'atath succeed, and Alleria loses her grip on the dark naaru within her... I fear all may be lost.\",\"timestamp\":1776712689,\"id\":\"s15_4863\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Ah, and my favorite champions as well! I was afraid you might miss this.\",\"timestamp\":1776712689,\"id\":\"s15_4864\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner grimaces in pain.\",\"timestamp\":1776712698,\"id\":\"s15_4865\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID\",\"type\":\"RAID\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4980392456054688,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:RAID|h[Raid]|h |Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal:510:RAID:|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h: (j'ai need pour ma double spé)\",\"timestamp\":1776712698,\"id\":\"s15_4866\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Arator yells: What are you doing to her?!\",\"timestamp\":1776712699,\"id\":\"s15_4867\"},{\"r