SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger Captain Lilatha says: Xal'atath's absence only mitigates the threat. We still have much to do!\",\"id\":\"s16_2836\",\"timestamp\":1776856472},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Captain Lilatha\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger Captain Lilatha says: The threat to our people has not ended. We need your help to counter this rash of new hostile activity.\",\"id\":\"s16_2837\",\"timestamp\":1776856487},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Captain Lilatha\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger Captain Lilatha says: Your efforts to help us in these dark days brought you to my attention. I know with your assistance we will put a quick end to these new threats.\",\"id\":\"s16_2838\",\"timestamp\":1776856499},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Camberon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Camberon says: I'm far too busy to keep up with your training, but you're welcome to use my cauldron over there.\",\"id\":\"s16_2839\",\"timestamp\":1776856514},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Goblin\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Stamz-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stamz-Hyjal|h[|cff00ff98Stamz|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62223:Player-1390-0D631AE4:1:4:22:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Alchemy-on-Demand]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s16_2840\",\"timestamp\":1776856534},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"ra