_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Er'inye says: Yes, yes! Let it flow through you!\",\"timestamp\":1787049274,\"id\":\"s18_4715\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Er'inye\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Er'inye says: You feel stronger, eh? More volatile? But we have only just begun.\",\"timestamp\":1787049306,\"id\":\"s18_4716\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Er'inye\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Er'inye says: Return to me with more corroded coins, and I will show you de ways of dis dark place.\",\"timestamp\":1787049311,\"id\":\"s18_4717\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warleader Abdumati\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Warleader Abdumati yells: Hear that slithering? The serpents will swarm soon.\",\"timestamp\":1787049365,\"id\":\"s18_4718\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Warleader Abdumati\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Warleader Abdumati yells: Cut them down! Butcher the summoners!\",\"timestamp\":1787049424,\"id\":\"s18_4719\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:274951::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Corroded Scale]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1787049512,\"id\":\"s18_4720\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeI